}}

==Enemy==
Baa Baa is a standard peon. It may look powerful, but it's only half as strong as [[Hippoe]], with 500 HP and 50 attack power at 100% strength magnification, and drops a fair amount of money to boot. It does not have Area Attack, but its attack rate is quick. Baa Baas are usually spawned in groups as support for much tougher opponents. Unlike other early peons such as [[Doge]] and [[Squire Rel]], Baa Baa is never buffed to an extreme extent, so it's not much of a threat in any stage.

==Strategy==
Baa Baa can usually be ignored. With proper meatshielding, it can never hit your attackers. [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat/UFO Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat/Mythical Titan Cat]] can make quick work of groups of Baa Baas. In general, they can be defeated by almost anything that can attack Traitless.

