==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Baa Baa
|Ghost Baa Baa
|Baa Baa's [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant, with twice as much health and attack power. First introduced in [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]], it also appears in [[The Haunted 1LDK]].
|UltraBaaBaa
|Baa Baa's [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant, with increased movement speed and higher damage, but more importantly, a [[Barrier]] with 266,000 HP. Still has single-target attacks.
|Haterbaa 2.0
|Baa Baa's [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant, with less health but much more damage. Luckily, it still only has single-target attacks. First appears in [[Lovesick Again (Monthly Event)|Lovesick Again]].
|Mega Baa Baa
|Baa Baa's [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant, with an Omni Strike that adds 30 piercing range to the 200 it stands at, as well as the [[Counter-Surge]] ability. Hits much harder and up to three times per attack, but is still a single-target enemy.
}}

