==Trivia==
*Baa Baa has no stated gender in [[The Battle Cats]], but was referred to as male in its description from the first English version, [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|Battle Cats]]: "Being ordinary is his complex. So he takes comedy skill lessons in a university."
*Baa Baa's and its variants' descriptions involve their appearances. Baa Baa has corny looks, [[UltraBaaBaa]]'s spiky looks are just bad bedhead, and [[Mega Baa Baa]] was at first pleased with its idiosyncratic body, but soon wished that its transformation had been a bit more ambitious. Mega Baa Baa's Japanese description also says it wants to raise its nasal bridge.

